        'No mention of performance, SEO or accessibility anywhere in the pitch.',
        'Vague ownership of the domain, hosting or code.',
        'A stunning portfolio of designs, but no live sites you can visit and test yourself.',
        'Communication that is already slow or unclear before you have even paid — it does not improve later.',
